#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8772
#: ccbbdce9f42d4cfda3986d114ad3eb00
msgid ""
"选择 `DeepMD NPY` 时，再选择子目录按 `Config_type` 还是按化学式分组。选择 Mixed 时显示“虚拟原子填充”：`0`"
" 按精确原子数分组，正整数按 dpdata 的 `atom_numb_pad` 规则向上补齐，使不同原子数可进入同一目录。XYZ "
"不显示这两个选项。"
msgstr ""
"When `DeepMD NPY` is selected, choose whether subdirectories are grouped "
"by `Config_type` or by chemical formula. With Mixed, `Virtual-atom "
"padding` is shown: `0` groups by exact atom count, while a positive "
"integer rounds counts up according to dpdata's `atom_numb_pad` rule so "
"systems with different atom counts can share a directory. These two "
"options are not shown for XYZ."

